Stub the FDE cryptfs functions that vold 14.1 no longer provides.

Run 39179952900 failed compiling partitionmanager.cpp:
  use of undeclared identifier 'cryptfs_get_password_type'
  use of undeclared identifier 'cryptfs_check_passwd'
partition.cpp calls set_partition_data/cryptfs_check_footer on the same
kind of FDE fallback path. vold 14.1 (like AOSP since Android 13) has no
FDE, so cryptfs.h only declares the ext-volume helpers. This adds
twrp_fde_compat.h with stubs that fail, included next to cryptfs.h.
FBE devices with a keydirectory, such as rothko, never take these paths.
Applies after 0002.

